     2384             VIEW-AS EDITOR SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
     2385             SIZE 52.5 BY 2
     2386        x-abc-analysis.abc-id AT ROW 2.25 COL 19 COLON-ALIGNED
     2387             LABEL "Вн.код ABC анализа"
     2388              VIEW-AS TEXT
     2389             SIZE 14 BY .67
