     2542       ASSIGN x-abc-analysis.abc-a x-abc-analysis.abc-b x-abc-analysis.abc-c x-abc-analysis.abc-d x-abc-analysis.abc-e  .
     2543   RUN proc-sel-rec
     2544   ( x-abc-analysis.abc-a,
     2545   x-abc-analysis.abc-b,
     2546   x-abc-analysis.abc-c,
     2547   x-abc-analysis.abc-d,
     2548   x-abc-analysis.abc-e
